of the emulated mesh output (every corner in front of the camera, spanning more than half the screen in NDC), the
number of groups holding them and, for the first 8 such groups, the task they belong to (prefix sum of the payload
counts, as the distribution pass computes it), their place among its mesh workgroups and the task's payload words.

